          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A memorial card printer in Ireland whose fifteen-year-old website could not take an order on a phone."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Most customers were grieving, on a phone, and ordering for the first time. The old site needed a desktop, a download and a phone call. Competitors had moved online years earlier."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A new store built for phones: choose a design, upload a photo, preview, pay",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Every design indexed with its own page and structured data",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Content written with care for the searches people make in the days after a loss",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Local pages for every county served",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Clear, quotable answers on timing, delivery and wording so AI tools cite the business",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The new store ranks on page one for forty target searches and orders are up 120%, most of them placed on a phone."
        }
      ]
